@* A short information within a block, which is no error (e.g. the authors of an album just taken from its series,
   visuel/saisie-album/contenu.md): an icon and its text, in a frame of the information color. A box within the page, never a
   control: the radius of a tile. *@
<div class="notice" role="status">
    <Icon Name="Icon" />
    <p class="notice-text">@ChildContent</p>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public IconName Icon { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
